484
00:53:39.538 --> 00:53:41.267
There are...

485
00:53:41.307 --> 00:53:44.936
some things...

486
00:53:44.977 --> 00:53:47.036
I need you to do for me.

487
00:53:47.079 --> 00:53:51.413
In my desk,
in the center drawer,

488
00:53:51.450 --> 00:53:54.078
