- Amanda...

495
00:54:20.913 --> 00:54:24.440
you can.
You can.

496
00:54:24.483 --> 00:54:26.474
You're stronger now.

497
00:54:28.821 --> 00:54:30.846
And I believe in you.

498
00:54:35.728 --> 00:54:38.595
You chose her
