534
00:58:24.456 --> 00:58:25.821
Let the game begin.

535
00:58:25.858 --> 00:58:28.190
Please get me out of here, please.

536
00:58:32.331 --> 00:58:33.730
What is that?

537
00:58:37.102 --> 00:58:38.763
