a limited supply of air.

1031
01:56:05.280 --> 01:56:08.977
And if you want to get her back,
you'll have to play a game.

1032
01:56:09.017 --> 01:56:11.178
No!

1033
01:56:12.187 --> 01:56:14.178
No!
